OL,3,AActor targets 'scarred villain' screen
OL,4,Astereotype
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne casting agency said visible
OL,7,Fdifferences were often used as a
OL,8,Fshorthand for villainy, but that these
OL,9,Fcasting briefs could be successfully
OL,10,Fchallenged.
